# voltmouse — electric, stage 2 of 3: the same, plus the line's crest.
# the quadruped again — the fan and the colour are the difference.
# Nobody drew this creature. It is four tiles of textures/parts_creature.pix
# and two colour swaps, and its evolution is this file plus one more part.
mix1
name voltmouse
size 16 16
sheet parts textures/parts_creature.hrt 16
part parts 8 at 0 0    # crest
part parts 0 at 0 0    # body
part parts 3 at 0 0    # face
swap 6f7686 e0c020    # body
swap b9c0cf fff3a0    # accent
